Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.53,0:01:27.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 荷尔拜先生 - 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- ah, master holbein. - my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.00,0:01:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还有一事须交由您去办\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have another commission for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.73,0:01:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克里维斯公爵已准许 由您\N{\fnArial\fs30}The duke of cleves has given you permission to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.00,0:01:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为其女安画像 着您即刻启程\N{\fnArial\fs30}Paint his daughter anne you should leave at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.53,0:01:37.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阁下要务缠身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your honor has so many pressing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.06,0:01:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}却还有时间谈论绘画\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet you have time to talk about a painting?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.39,0:01:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这并非平常画像 荷尔拜 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is no ordinary painting, mr. holbein.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.13,0:01:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此事事关重大\N{\fnArial\fs30}A great many things hang upon it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.19,0:01:48.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}正因如此 无论那位女士真实相貌如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}To that effect, however you find the lady, whatever her actual appearance,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.09,0:01:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我都恳求您 至少把她画得赏心悦目\N{\fnArial\fs30}I pray you, use your art and give her at least a pleasing countenance.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.31,0:01:54.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即使她奇丑无比 也如此吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}even if she is as ugly as sin?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.74,0:01:57.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那她倒还不至那般不堪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am fairly certain she is not so.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.46,0:02:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽管如此 您还是希望我需要的话 美化她吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}but still, you wish me, if necessary, to lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.75,0:02:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}显然一切艺术皆为美化 荷尔拜先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}surely all art is a lie, mr. holbein.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.64,0:02:12.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人们\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lords,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.73,0:02:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}鉴于法国国王与罗马皇帝签署了托莱多条约\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since the signing of the treaty of toledo between the french king and the emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.47,0:02:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两国意图共侵我国\N{\fnArial\fs30}there have been vital and unavoidable signs.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.69,0:02:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已如箭在弦一触即发\N{\fnArial\fs30}of their mutual preparations for war against this realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.80,0:02:26.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们知道在罗马教皇的煽动下 他们万分迫切\N{\fnArial\fs30}We know how much they have been urged on by the vicar of rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.01,0:02:29.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们已获确切情报 他们在安特卫普及布洛涅两地\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now we hear competent reports of fleets gathering.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.03,0:02:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}集结舰队 在荷兰也集结了一支军队\N{\fnArial\fs30}At antwerp and boulogne, and of an army in the netherlands.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.54,0:02:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}另外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Furthermore,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.64,0:02:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法国和罗马的大使也都被召回\N{\fnArial\fs30}The french and imperial ambassadors have been recalled by their masters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.89,0:02:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}诸位 在剑拔弩张之当下 我们并未放松警惕\N{\fnArial\fs30}my lords, we have not been idle under such provocations.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.77,0:02:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们已召集防卫军\N{\fnArial\fs30}Defense forces have been mustered and.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.37,0:02:47.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并在海岸边界设立烽火台戒备\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beacons set up along the coast for warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.16,0:02:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们也已着手在英吉利海峡边筑建堡垒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Work has also begun building ancillary forts facing the english channel.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.88,0:02:54.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同时巩固了北面对苏格兰的边防线\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the north we've strengthened our borders against the scots.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.05,0:02:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下的战舰队也处于备战状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his majesty's fleet of warships has been provisioned.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.51,0:02:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有国王的允许\N{\fnArial\fs30}And foreign vessels have been forbidden to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.92,0:03:02.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}任何外国船只不得离岸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave these shores without royal permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.75,0:03:12.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人们 任谁都清楚那位主教大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lords, how can anyone doubt that the pope.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.43,0:03:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那位为祸人间的偶像\N{\fnArial\fs30}that pestilent idol,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.31,0:03:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是真理的敌人 是妄图篡权的掠夺者\N{\fnArial\fs30}That enemy of truth and usurpator of all princes,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.83,0:03:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如今正密谋破坏英格兰的信仰 掠夺我们的财富\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is now conspiring to corrupt england's religion and strip her of her wealth?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.39,0:03:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}诸位 此时正是顺应民心的大好时机\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lords, at such a time it is good for me to be amongst my people.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.61,0:03:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我将巡视国内所有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will visit all the places where the.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.18,0:03:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}建筑防备工事之地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Barricades and defenses of the realm are Being built,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.73,0:03:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以此鼓舞军心 震慑敌军\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the encouragement of my troops and to the terror of my enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.93,0:03:42.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下英明\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.42,0:03:56.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来我们腹背受敌了 弗朗西斯爵士\N{\fnArial\fs30}it seems we are threatened from everywhere, sir francis.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.30,0:03:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}苏格兰 西班牙 以及其他低地国家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scotland. spain, the low countries.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.00,0:04:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人为刀俎 我为鱼肉啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are like a morsel among these choppers!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.09,0:04:03.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再告诉你件事吧 汤姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tell you something something else, tom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.63,0:04:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}据克伦威尔的探子回报\N{\fnArial\fs30}According to cromwell's agents,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.99,0:04:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两周前 珀尔主教离开罗马执行秘密任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just two weeks ago cardinal pole left rome on a secret mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.58,0:04:09.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们要继续追捕他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}shall we be after him again?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.95,0:04:12.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一旦得知他的藏身之所 即刻行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}as soon as we have more news of his whereabouts, we shall.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.07,0:04:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}时刻准备着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sharpen your knives.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.49,0:04:21.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 公爵大人 - 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- your grace. - my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.99,0:04:26.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 可以私下聊聊吗 - 改天吧 大人 现在不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- may we talk in private? - some time, my lord. not now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.29,0:04:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}荷尔拜先生送来了克里维斯的安的画像 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}mr. holbein has sent this portrait of anne of cleves, your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.11,0:04:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她挺惹人喜爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}she is pleasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.72,0:04:44.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们的大使和她正式见过面了吗 - 是的 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Has our ambassador been able to see her properly? - yes, your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.11,0:04:47.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约翰爵士来信中高度评价了公主的为人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir john has written to me in great praise of the princess' person.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.43,0:04:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他写道\N{\fnArial\fs30}He writes,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.21,0:04:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她无与伦比 更胜米兰公爵夫人一筹\N{\fnArial\fs30}"she is incomparable and excels the duchess of milan.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.82,0:04:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}宛若灿烂的阳光胜过苍白的月光\N{\fnArial\fs30}as the golden sun excels the silver moon."
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.83,0:05:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 不知是否当讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}your majesty if I may?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.99,0:05:05.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同米兰公爵夫人的联姻已无可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}marriage to the duchess of milan is no longer an option.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.80,0:05:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}由于法国同罗马帝国已联手对抗我国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor, since the french and the emperor are in league against us,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.40,0:05:12.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同法国联姻也已无望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are any of the french women.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.49,0:05:15.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下已然腹背受敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty is beset by enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.34,0:05:19.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而同克里维斯的安联姻 能与新教国结成联盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Marriage to anne of cleves would bring with it the.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.01,0:05:23.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在军事上和经济上的大力支持\N{\fnArial\fs30}Military and financial support of the protestant league.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.29,0:06:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么 怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}what? what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.71,0:06:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}敌船上挂着黑鹰旗帜\N{\fnArial\fs30}enemy ships flying the black eagle!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.90,0:06:06.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}let me look!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.90,0:06:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是罗马帝国的船舰\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's imperial ships!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.05,0:06:16.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看在上帝的份上 点燃烽火台\N{\fnArial\fs30}for lord's sake, light the beacon!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.60,0:06:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.94,0:06:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Light it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.04,0:06:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看在上帝的份上\N{\fnArial\fs30}For god's sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.02,0:06:37.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}天鹅宫 克里维斯 德国\N{\fnArial\fs30}Swan Castle Cleves, Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.51,0:06:38.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}威廉公爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}duke william,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.11,0:06:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下对您妹妹安的画像赞不绝口\N{\fnArial\fs30}His majesty is much taken by the portrait of your sister anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.03,0:06:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他敦促您派遣使节前往英格兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}He encourages you to send ambassadors to england to conclude negotiations,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.02,0:06:52.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}商讨关于嫁妆及诸项事宜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Including the question of a suitable dowry, and so on.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.94,0:06:56.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我再说一次 贵国陛下实在操之过急\N{\fnArial\fs30}once again his majesty is premature.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.03,0:07:00.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是 殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}but surely, your highness…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.76,0:07:04.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想国王应该亲自公开来访 屈膝跪地\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think the king should come to me publicly and on bended knee.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.23,0:07:09.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}企求我妹之芳心 及寻求联盟之保护\N{\fnArial\fs30}To beg for my sister's hand and for the protection of the league.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.88,0:07:14.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无论如何 安已正式许配给了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In any case, anne is already promised, formally,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.64,0:07:16.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}洛林公爵之子 我不知\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the duke of lorraine's son and I do not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.74,0:07:20.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要如何出尔反尔 却又能保住尊严\N{\fnArial\fs30}See how I can break that promise and keep my honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.23,0:07:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}殿下 若真如此 这实乃事出意外的坏消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}your highness, if true, this is most unexpected and unwelcome news.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.98,0:07:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是因为你们从一开始就\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is because you expected from.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.39,0:07:29.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}觊觎克利维斯的力量及我妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}The start to have your way with cleves.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.15,0:07:30.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my sister,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.87,0:07:34.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不是青楼妓院 我妹也不是妓女\N{\fnArial\fs30}but my country is not a brothel and my sister is not a whore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.26,0:07:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既然如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.58,0:07:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你们主子真心寻求结盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}if your master truly desires to have an alliance,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.66,0:07:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么请他展示对我国的敬意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then he must demonstrate his respect for my country…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.54,0:07:55.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并为得到我妹之童贞出个更高的价钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}And put a better price on my sister's virginity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.77,0:08:01.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}make way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.21,0:08:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让开 让开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make way! make way!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.49,0:08:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 给国王陛下的急件 - 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}- message for the king! - sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.40,0:08:10.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这边走 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.94,0:08:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给陛下的急件\N{\fnArial\fs30}a message for his majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.45,0:08:22.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.74,0:08:32.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是五港的看守托马斯·切尼的来信\N{\fnArial\fs30}"from sir thomas cheyney, warden, the cinque ports.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.41,0:08:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 诸位枢密院大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}"your majesty, lords of council,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.22,0:08:38.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今晨在海峡边出现68艘罗马帝国船只\N{\fnArial\fs30}This morning we counted "68 imperial ships in the channel.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.95,0:08:40.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我派出两艘船前去探听虚实\N{\fnArial\fs30}"i sent out two ships, and,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.28,0:08:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}随后我方船员登上罗马帝国的船只\N{\fnArial\fs30}"afterwards my boatmen were taken aboard the.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.93,0:08:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}该船舰长对我船员礼遇有加\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imperial flagship "and shown every courtesy by the admiral.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.34,0:08:50.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说他们的船队意欲驶往西班牙 而非英格兰\N{\fnArial\fs30}"he said his fleet was bound for spain and not england,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.43,0:08:53.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因而对我方或我海岸并无任何觊觎\N{\fnArial\fs30}"and that he meant no harm whatever "to us or our coast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.77,0:08:56.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}若不信可以查看\N{\fnArial\fs30}"if they doubted his word they had only to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.05,0:08:58.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其船只甚少武装装备\N{\fnArial\fs30}How poorly armed "his ships were, equipped more.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.31,0:08:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}反而如普通商船一般\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like merchantmen,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.81,0:09:04.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们负责输送罗马皇帝前往君士坦丁堡之航行所需物资\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their holds bursting with provisions for the emperor's voyage to constantinople."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.60,0:09:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 帝国大使觐见\N{\fnArial\fs30}the imperial ambassador, your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.19,0:09:26.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我以为您已被召回\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you'd been recalled.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.06,0:09:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}眼下的确是有一些传言 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}there was some talk, your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.39,0:09:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可我无意离开 我想也没有理由离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I had no desire to leave here nor did I think there was any cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.94,0:09:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有理由\N{\fnArial\fs30}no cause?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.15,0:09:37.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贵国陛下已同法王\N{\fnArial\fs30}But your master and the french king.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.65,0:09:39.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}缔结盟约与我为敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}had formed an alliance against me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.00,0:09:43.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在罗马教廷的撺掇下\N{\fnArial\fs30}There appeared to be preparations for an invasion,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.86,0:09:45.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已磨刀霍霍 意图入侵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Encouraged by the vicar of rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.54,0:09:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 我任职时间不短\N{\fnArial\fs30}your majesty, I've been in this job a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.40,0:09:51.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}知道什么时候该信 什么时候不该信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know when to believe what I am told and When not to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.50,0:09:54.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}多数情况下 是不该采信的\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is most of the time.hmm…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.97,0:09:57.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽管皇帝陛下公开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Although the emperor publicly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.40,0:09:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拥抱了法王 甚至亲手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Embraced the french king and even gave him the.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.76,0:10:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将颈上的金羊毛勋章赠与他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Order of the golden fleece from around his own neck,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.56,0:10:05.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可我主陛下依然憎恶他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He still continued to hate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.65,0:10:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}众多敌国之中 我主陛下最惧土耳其人\N{\fnArial\fs30}More than any other enemy, my master fears the turks,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.38,0:10:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可法王仍与他们结盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}And yet the french are in league with them!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.86,0:10:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}同为天主教帝国君主\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is such behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.07,0:10:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这种行为岂能容谅\N{\fnArial\fs30}from another christian monarch to be forgiven?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.54,0:10:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 那他们已不再结盟了么 - 尚未\N{\fnArial\fs30}- then they are no longer in alliance? - no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.50,0:10:23.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但已面和心不合\N{\fnArial\fs30}The accord is already broken down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.25,0:10:26.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如此一来 米兰公爵夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Which means that the duchess of milan is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.22,0:10:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也可再次待选为陛下之妻\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once more available for your majesty's bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.58,0:10:33.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太迟了 查普维斯阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's too late, mr. chapuys.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.56,0:10:35.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}查普维斯阁下 说说看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Chapuys, tell me,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.53,0:10:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我又一次作为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I to be relieved that once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.18,0:10:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法王与贵主陛下博弈的一颗棋子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been used as a pawn in a game.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.51,0:10:40.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这回我能轻松了么\N{\fnArial\fs30}between your master and the french king?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.35,0:10:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此时此地 我告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tell you this, here and now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.95,0:10:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我忍无可忍 查普维斯阁下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had enough, mr. chapuys!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.92,0:10:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我忍无可忍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.20,0:10:57.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您可以退下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You may leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.52,0:11:20.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两位阁下如此迅速折返 着实令人惊喜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am surprised to see you back so soon, excellencies.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.49,0:11:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}殿下 我们有喜讯禀报\N{\fnArial\fs30}we have good news, your highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.56,0:11:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喜从何来\N{\fnArial\fs30}how so?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.75,0:11:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下非令妹安妮不娶\N{\fnArial\fs30}His majesty is so desirous to marry your sister anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.32,0:11:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他宁可不要嫁妆\N{\fnArial\fs30}That he is willing to forfeit the requirements of a dowry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.89,0:11:36.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他什么都不要吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}he wants nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.17,0:11:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要能与他的新娘速速成婚\N{\fnArial\fs30}only his new bride, in as short a time as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.08,0:11:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下还会支付给殿下您\N{\fnArial\fs30}His majesty will also pay your highness a.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.46,0:11:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一笔数目可观的津贴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Considerable stipend.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.50,0:11:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}以酬谢殿下您撮合陛下与新教联盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}for introducing him to the league.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.75,0:11:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此外\N{\fnArial\fs30}however,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.55,0:11:54.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们知晓令妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}We recall that your sister is already.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.52,0:11:57.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}已许给了洛林公爵之子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promised to the son of the duke of lorraine.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.63,0:11:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}的确如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}ah, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.33,0:12:01.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那确是一大阻碍\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was indeed a great obstacle.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.96,0:12:04.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然而 近期经过考证\N{\fnArial\fs30}However, on closer consideration,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.97,0:12:09.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们发觉婚约尚未获准\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have discovered that the contract was never ratified,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.34,0:12:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为不受法律或其他形式的约束\N{\fnArial\fs30}And so is not binding in law or any other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.93,0:12:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么令妹仍可许给国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}so your sister is free to marry the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.92,0:12:22.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我将派遣使臣前往英国定下婚约\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will send my ambassadors to england to conclude the negotiations.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.45,0:12:26.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢了 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.67,0:12:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's this?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.15,0:12:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克伦威尔的探子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cromwell's agents.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.43,0:12:59.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还是截到了珀尔主教的信\N{\fnArial\fs30}finally intercepted a letter from cardinal pole.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.21,0:13:00.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是送往罗马的途中截获的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was on its way to rome.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.06,0:13:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我设法破译了它 - 我能看看吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I have managed to decode it. - may I see?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.01,0:13:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}冯·瓦尔德巴主教敬启\N{\fnArial\fs30}"to cardinal von waldburg.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.54,0:13:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}本该前往巴黎面见弗朗西斯国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}"supposed to travel to paris to meet king francis.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.28,0:13:16.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}此前已去信\N{\fnArial\fs30}"have already written,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.91,0:13:18.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告知罗马帝国皇帝陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Telling him I found the emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.07,0:13:20.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}十分支持我此项使命\N{\fnArial\fs30}"very sympathetic to my mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.75,0:13:22.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可我担心并非如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}"but fear it is not so.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.04,0:13:25.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}较亨利国王而言 罗马帝国皇帝更忌惮土耳其\N{\fnArial\fs30}"the emperor fears the turk more than king henry,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.63,0:13:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}故此我确信陛下不会对亨利国王采取行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}"so believe he will not act against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.81,0:13:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此行程延期\N{\fnArial\fs30}"so postponed journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.87,0:13:36.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}将先去往教廷辖区卡彭特拉斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}"will go instead "to papal city of carpentras.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.99,0:13:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}原地待教皇陛下之命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Await further instruction from his holiness."
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.90,0:13:43.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去过卡彭特拉斯吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}have you ever been to carpentras?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.91,0:13:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}no.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.42,0:13:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可我迫不及待\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm dying to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.04,0:13:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 大人 萨福克公爵到 - 公爵大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- the duke of suffolk, my lord. - your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.91,0:13:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贵人到访不胜荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}To what do I owe this honor?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.88,0:14:00.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我来此恭贺您\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to congratulate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.45,0:14:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道国王已封您为何福特伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand the king has made you earl of hertford.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.61,0:14:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想也到了摒除异议\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I believe it is time to.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.18,0:14:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尽释前嫌的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}patch up our past quarrels and differences.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.39,0:14:10.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}应该多多商讨而非争论\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are better quarrels to be had.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.56,0:14:14.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很高兴与大人意见一致\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am happy to agree with your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.06,0:14:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}喝一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.29,0:14:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}劳驾\N{\fnArial\fs30}please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.26,0:14:24.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.06,0:14:34.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我奉王命去加来面见公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am commanded to meet the princess at calais.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.87,0:14:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}太多事悬于这桩婚事 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}A great many things hang upon this marriage, do they not?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.42,0:14:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比方说 国王的幸福\N{\fnArial\fs30}the king's happiness, for one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.42,0:14:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有克伦威尔大人的威信\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my lord cromwell's reputation.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.95,0:14:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}倘若她因某些原因 有甚闪失 那可太遗憾了\N{\fnArial\fs30}what a pity if all should go awry for some reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.47,0:14:56.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我将对国王深感同情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would have pity for the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.71,0:14:58.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对另一方面呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}but on the other hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.96,0:15:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Salut.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.65,0:15:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}干杯\N{\fnArial\fs30}salut.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.12,0:15:10.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么他真要娶信奉路德教的异教徒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}so he is marrying a lutheran heretic?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.55,0:15:13.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 看来如此 - 那我谁也不嫁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- so it seems. - and I shall marry no one!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.78,0:15:17.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 小姐 我 - 不 我宁可如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}- my lady, i… - no. I prefer it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.90,0:15:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想我会愿意嫁给公爵的兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you suppose I would like to be married off to the duke's brother,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.24,0:15:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或者他的什么异教徒表亲吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or some heretic cousin of his?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.97,0:15:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我宁可住进修道院\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would prefer to live in a nunnery!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.36,0:15:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真不知道国王怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not know what to think of the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.51,0:15:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}烧死了个路德教徒 再娶个路德教徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}He burns one lutheran, and then marries another!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.10,0:15:39.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么 既然是上帝安排的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if god so wills it,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.93,0:15:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她也许会淹死在海上\N{\fnArial\fs30}she might drown at sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.74,0:15:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}切克斯城堡 加来 英属法国领地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chequers, Calais English Occupied France.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.57,0:16:07.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}gentlemen,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.71,0:16:11.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}值此良辰吉日 我们欢迎各位莅临加来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We bid you welcome to calais on this most auspicious occasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.72,0:16:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}danke.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.05,0:16:18.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请允许我介绍萨福克公爵殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}may I present to you his grace, the duke of suffolk.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.84,0:16:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 十分荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}your grace. an honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.83,0:16:25.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我叫霍斯顿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Herr Hoghesten,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.58,0:16:28.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这位是奥列斯卡伯爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this is Count Olisleger,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.90,0:16:30.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您好\N{\fnArial\fs30}hallo.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.05,0:16:38.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}安妮公主殿下 即刻驾到 精诚所至 上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her highness, princess anne, after a long time my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.06,0:17:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公主殿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}your highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.57,0:17:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}日安 公爵大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}good day, your grace.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.70,0:17:27.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}气候条件恶劣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid the bad weather.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.76,0:17:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恐怕要耽搁几日航程\N{\fnArial\fs30}will prevent our sailing for a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.97,0:17:33.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.97,0:17:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}公爵大人能否\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps your grace could, uh,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.77,0:17:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拨冗为我介绍一下英国的进餐礼仪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me to explain how the english are eating?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.53,0:17:49.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}义不容辞\N{\fnArial\fs30}of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.40,0:17:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且告诉我国王陛下的一些爱好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and maybe show me something the king likes to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.05,0:18:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下喜好玩牌九还有赌博\N{\fnArial\fs30}his majesty likes to play cards and gamble.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.35,0:18:04.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您玩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you play?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.26,0:18:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}噢 不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.02,0:18:10.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我国只有男子赌牌九\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think only the men play the cards in my country, ja?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.32,0:18:15.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赌博不是不好的么\N{\fnArial\fs30}is it not bad to gamble?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.10,0:18:16.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要是输得起就没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}not if you can afford to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.77,0:18:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们来玩皮克牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll play piquet.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.64,0:18:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 一点都不难学 - 太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's not hard to learn. - that is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.49,0:18:25.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}扑克牌有四种花色\N{\fnArial\fs30}there are four suits of cards comme ca.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.78,0:18:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}分别是 黑桃 梅花 方块 还有红心\N{\fnArial\fs30}spades, clubs, diamonds and hearts.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.93,0:18:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}红心 你喜欢玩弄感情\N{\fnArial\fs30}hearts? you play with hearts?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.37,0:18:38.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有时候吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.66,0:18:46.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这里我们有王牌 国王 王后和杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}And here we have aces, kings, queens and knaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.14,0:18:50.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}整个宫廷都在这儿了 是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}ah! then all the court is here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.82,0:18:57.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王总是赢牌吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}does the king always win?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.50,0:19:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下不喜欢输\N{\fnArial\fs30}his majesty does not like losing.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.53,0:19:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们是怎么跟您说国王的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have they told you about the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.96,0:19:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}why?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.47,0:19:19.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有什么是我该知道的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it I should know?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.55,0:19:34.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你是弗朗西斯·布莱恩吗 - 可以带我们去见红衣主教吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you're francis bryan? - you can take us to the cardinal?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.48,0:19:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 快来 他和我们在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}si. yes. come quickly. he is with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.39,0:19:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那杂种在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}where is the bastard?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.03,0:20:18.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, signor.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.44,0:20:21.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}愿主保佑\N{\fnArial\fs30}e prego.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.58,0:20:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}追随上帝的指引 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go with god, my sons.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.37,0:20:33.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们永远也抓不到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll never catch him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.57,0:20:36.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}纯属浪费时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}A waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.43,0:20:39.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}perhaps not.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.93,0:20:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}o dulcis…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.93,0:21:03.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}仁慈的主啊 圣母玛利亚之子 请怜悯我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}O pie, o jesu fili mariae; miserere mei…
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.19,0:21:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}圣母玛利亚请保佑我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy Mary Pray for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.84,0:21:13.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}引渡我躲过敌人的追捕\N{\fnArial\fs30}and deliver me from my enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.33,0:21:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amen.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.00,0:21:24.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你没看见她的脸 - 没有 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you didn't see her face? - no, your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.50,0:21:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但她打牌时和气可爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she plays cards as pleasantly and with as.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.80,0:21:29.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}高雅端庄的姿态一如我见过的任何贵族女子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good a grace as ever in my life I saw any noble woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.36,0:21:31.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她已经到了罗切斯特市\N{\fnArial\fs30}she's come to rochester.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.49,0:21:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我将在三日后见她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm due to meet her in three days time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.80,0:21:38.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}告诉你吧 我迫不及待地要见她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tell you, I'm more impatient than ever to see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.03,0:21:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}弗朗西斯·布莱恩爵士进展如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}What of sir francis bryan?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.23,0:21:45.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他和托马斯·西摩爵士已经到了卡朋特拉斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}he and sir thomas seymour are arrived in carpentras,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.91,0:21:48.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}珀尔主教应该是藏在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where cardinal pole is supposed to be hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.99,0:21:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}显然他开始害怕被暗杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}It appears he has grown fearful of assassination.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.18,0:21:55.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他应当日此\N{\fnArial\fs30}he has every right to be so.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.21,0:21:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我发誓\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.80,0:21:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那人该被剥皮 然后我要把他的皮当衬衫穿\N{\fnArial\fs30}That man should be flayed alive and I should wear his skin as a shirt!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.86,0:22:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他终有一天会后悔 容许教皇利用他来威胁我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will rue the day he allowed the pope to use him to threaten me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.12,0:22:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}跟你说 我实在等不了了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tell you, I cannot abide this waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.36,0:22:13.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我等的够久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.26,0:22:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我需要爱情的浇灌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to nourish love!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.91,0:22:19.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我理解 - 你能吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I can understand. - can you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.43,0:22:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想要得到这个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to possess this woman…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.72,0:22:27.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但至今仍未见过她\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I haven't even seen her!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.69,0:22:31.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对我来说 她完全是个陌生人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's a complete stranger to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.09,0:22:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if I can't…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.33,0:22:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果您不能 怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}what if you can't… what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.67,0:22:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来人\N{\fnArial\fs30}groom!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.80,0:22:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.49,0:22:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}把马师叫来 我即刻动身去往罗切斯特市 快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}fetch the master of the horse. I leave for rochester immediately. go!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.59,0:23:28.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让路\N{\fnArial\fs30}make way!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.51,0:23:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}下马\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dismount!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.27,0:23:44.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去通报小姐 一位绅士前来见她 带来了新年礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell the lady a gentleman has come to see her bearing a new year's gift.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.61,0:23:45.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.04,0:24:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.36,0:24:59.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我来此欢迎您来到我国\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to welcome you to my realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.31,0:25:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}相信您到访伦敦之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}I trust you are comfortable here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.12,0:25:09.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}会在此地过的十分愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}before your Journey to london.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.53,0:25:14.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢您 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}thank you, your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.67,0:25:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}稍后见\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will see you anon.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.55,0:25:48.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我该从公爵那儿多学点的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should have taken more lessons from the Duke.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.59,0:25:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}英格兰的礼仪同我国真是大有不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}English manners are very different from ours!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.85,0:26:09.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一点不喜欢她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like her not!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.56,0:26:11.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand me?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.83,0:26:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不喜欢她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like her not!!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.63,0:26:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}召开政务会议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Call a meeting of the council.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.79,0:26:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看起来王公贵族的婚姻比贫民的更悲惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems that princes in marriage suffer more than poor men,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.65,0:26:26.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为他们只能照单全收\N{\fnArial\fs30}Since they have to take what is brought to them,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.26,0:26:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而贫民却能自由的选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}While poor men are at liberty to choose.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.65,0:26:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于克里维斯的安 我被骗了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have been deceived about anne of cleves.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.55,0:26:36.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她同你们报告的截然不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is nothing like what was reported to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.14,0:26:40.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}截然不同 她看着就像匹马\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing! she looks like a horse!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.21,0:26:43.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一匹佛兰德斯母马\N{\fnArial\fs30}A flanders mare!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.04,0:26:53.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下应该还记得约翰爵士是怎么描述她的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty will remember that it was sir john who described her.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.01,0:26:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 长得就像 - 臣从未亲眼见过她 错不在臣\N{\fnArial\fs30}- As being like…- I never saw her properly which was not my fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.04,0:26:58.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已竭尽全力 尽忠职守\N{\fnArial\fs30}I carried out my commission as best I could.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.04,0:27:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且我告诉过你 我对女人所知甚少\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I told you I was no good with women.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.16,0:27:03.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克伦威尔大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}my lord cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.76,0:27:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您是在否认 曾对我吹嘘过她的美丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you deny that you spoke to me of her beauty,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.63,0:27:09.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}声称她会是我称心如意的新娘\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of the desirability of my marriage to her?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.74,0:27:10.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不否认 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}no, your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.81,0:27:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我因为错误的报告而误导了陛下和政务院\N{\fnArial\fs30}And if I have misled your majesty and his council by.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.00,0:27:17.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我深感遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commendations based on false reports, then I am truly sorry for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.25,0:27:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}早知如此 她是绝不会被带到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I had known what I know now, she would never have been brought here!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.36,0:27:24.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么补救 克伦威尔大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}What remedy, mr. cromwell?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.29,0:27:32.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 臣不得不说 别无他法\N{\fnArial\fs30}your majesty, I have to say that there is none.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.00,0:27:33.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's hardly the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.00,0:27:36.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克里维斯之事一开始就由您接手的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been following the cleves agenda from the beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.58,0:27:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.97,0:27:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如今罗马帝国皇帝已是法国国王的贵客\N{\fnArial\fs30}today the emperor is the guest of the king of france.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.09,0:27:49.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们已重新结盟\N{\fnArial\fs30}They have renewed their alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.16,0:27:51.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我们现在拒绝德国的联姻\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we now reject our german allies,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.95,0:27:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}英国将陷于孤立无援之地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then england will remain alone and friendless,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.20,0:27:57.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}任由法国国王和教皇的摆布\N{\fnArial\fs30}And at the mercy of the king and emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.56,0:28:00.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下 如果您现在解除婚约\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty, if you break this marriage contract now,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:00.44,0:28:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恐怕威廉公爵本人都会报复我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You risk the possibility that even of duke William himself might retaliate against us.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.65,0:28:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很抱歉陛下对此事不甚满意\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm…I'm sorry that your majesty has no better content.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.08,0:28:29.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这事没有处理好 克伦威尔先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not well handled, mr. cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.59,0:28:40.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.82,0:29:37.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}my lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.18,0:29:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}欢迎您的到来 这一切都属于您\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to welcome you to what is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.18,0:29:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下您真是十分慷慨 我很愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}your majesty is very gracious and I am very happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.19,0:30:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我的女儿们\N{\fnArial\fs30}My daughters.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.25,0:30:07.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}The princess mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:12.29,0:30:13.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}madam.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:17.41,0:30:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伊丽莎白公主\N{\fnArial\fs30}the princess elizabeth.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.59,0:30:32.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给您的 我觉得这花很漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}for you. I think they're pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.50,0:30:36.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢您 公主 您也很漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}thank you, princess. I think you are pretty, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.18,0:30:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会好好疼爱她们俩的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall love them both.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.48,0:31:13.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不喜欢她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like her not.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.87,0:31:17.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但看来陛下必须得娶她\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it seems that your majesty must marry her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.22,0:31:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谁说我必须娶她了 克伦威尔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}who says I must? cromwell?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.37,0:31:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我自有律师团在处理此事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have my lawyers working on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.42,0:31:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有两个办法解除婚约\N{\fnArial\fs30}The betrothal can be prevent on two grants.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.39,0:31:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要么就是德国使节\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either the german envoys fail to bring a.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.24,0:31:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有将公爵授予的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Commission from the duke authorizing them to conclude the.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.14,0:31:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}婚姻合法判决书送到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Legalities of the marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.27,0:31:32.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}要么就是他们不能提供公主的\N{\fnArial\fs30}or they can't provide written.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.23,0:31:35.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上一桩婚约被正式撤销的书面证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evidence that her previous betrothal was formally revoked.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.02,0:31:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两者取其一 我就能摆脱这桩婚事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either way, I can get out of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.88,0:31:42.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}衷心希望陛下您能如愿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish with all my heart that your majesty is successful.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:43.72,0:31:45.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在我看来 克伦威尔大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It seems to me that my lord cromwell is.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.88,0:31:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}十分强调这事完全没有回转的余地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Too keen to stress the lack of any remedy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.34,0:31:51.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这桩婚事是他的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}the marriage was his idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.36,0:31:53.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}本还有其他候选人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There were other candidates.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.31,0:31:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比如米兰的公爵夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}The duchess of milan is supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.90,0:31:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她可是天下无双的美人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be the most desirable woman in the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.89,0:31:58.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而不是这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead of which…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.85,0:32:06.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许 在这件事上\N{\fnArial\fs30}perhaps, in this matter,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.36,0:32:09.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}克伦威尔大人有点过分干预了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}my lord cromwell has overreached himself?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.47,0:32:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.85,0:32:18.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, god!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.82,0:32:22.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果不能挽回的话 我就只能套上这副绳索了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there is no remedy, I must put my neck into this yoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.30,0:32:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}my lord!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.60,0:33:00.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱歉 克伦威尔大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, lord cromwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.69,0:33:02.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我没看到您 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't see you. i…
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.00,0:33:07.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我正和上帝交谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was talking to god.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.58,0:33:11.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但显然 先生 您得去教堂才能祷告\N{\fnArial\fs30}but surely, sir, you have to go to church for that?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.22,0:33:16.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你对我们的改革一无所知吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}do you understand nothing of our reforms?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.51,0:33:21.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上帝不仅在教堂 他无所不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}God is not just in church. he is everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.50,0:33:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们不需要牧师为我们祷告\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do not need priests to speak for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.21,0:33:31.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们可以自行和他沟通 他会听到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can speak to him ourselves, and he will listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.07,0:33:35.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不必非要有排钟 圣经和蜡烛\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no need for bells and books and candles.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.69,0:33:39.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要有灵魂就够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you need is your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.11,0:33:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}退下吧 再好好想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now go away and think.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.62,0:33:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.07,0:34:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}今天是显灵节宴会\N{\fnArial\fs30}today is the feast of the epiphany.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.73,0:34:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也是我大婚之日\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my wedding day.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.32,0:34:56.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么 还是没有合法的解决途径吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So there was no legal remedy?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.77,0:35:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恐怕是找不着了 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}none that it was possible to discover, your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.19,0:35:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这事儿你没有办好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not well handled.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.04,0:35:09.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想只要您更深入了解她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think when your majesty gets to know the lady better…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.86,0:35:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不要深入了解她 克伦威尔先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to know the lady better, mr. cromwell!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.59,0:35:14.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一想到这件事就让我恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}The notion of it revolts me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.00,0:35:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人 如果不是为了江山社稷\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lord, if it were not to satisfy the world, and my realm,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.04,0:35:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是绝不会做今天我必须做的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would not do what I must do this day for no earthly thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.56,0:38:00.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以就寝了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}shall we to bed?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.86,0:38:06.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.75,0:38:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:24.16,0:41:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下觉得王后怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does your majesty like the queen?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.40,0:41:30.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很显然 大人 我以前不怎喜欢她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surely, my lord, I didn't like her very much before.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.56,0:41:32.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在更加讨厌她\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I like her much worse now!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.55,0:41:36.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她一点都不美好 她身上一股邪恶的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is nothing fair and she has evil smells about her!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.84,0:41:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从她松弛的胸部及其他表征\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I know she's no maid.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.92,0:41:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我就可以看出她根本不是处女\N{\fnArial\fs30}because of the looseness of her breasts and other tokens.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.95,0:41:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因此我没这个意愿也没这个勇气去继续探究\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I had neither the will nor the courage to prove the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.98,0:41:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对令人生厌的气味下我没一点性趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no appetite for unpleasant airs.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.01,0:41:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我让她来时什么样就是什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I left her as good a maid as I found her!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.97,0:41:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在 大人 退下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now, my lord, leave me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.54,0:41:56.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm very busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:59.11,0:42:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.96,0:42:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 亲爱的 - 我睡不着\N{\fnArial\fs30}- sweetheart. - I couldn't sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.90,0:42:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 谁在那儿 - 没人 回你床上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who is there? - no one. go back to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.16,0:42:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我过会儿可以来陪你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall I come to you later?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.36,0:42:47.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你还是我以前亲爱的查尔斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you could still be my sweet charles.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.82,0:42:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和从前一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am as good as I may be.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.38,0:42:52.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要对此深信不疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you must take me as I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.10,0:42:57.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我爱你 凯瑟琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you, catherine.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.47,0:43:16.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我已经把脓血从您的伤口抽出来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have drained the pus from your majesty's wound.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.99,0:43:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您应该不会再忍受疼痛了 感谢上帝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your majesty should feel no more pain, thanks be to god.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.76,0:43:36.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恕我冒昧 您还有其他烦心事儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me, but is your majesty troubled by other things?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:40.32,0:43:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不能和安女士圆房\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have been unable to consummate my marriage with the lady anne.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.75,0:43:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我觉得她的身体有点 病弱欠佳\N{\fnArial\fs30}I find her body in such a sort, disordered and indisposed,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.70,0:43:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}无法激起我的一丝性欲\N{\fnArial\fs30}That it doesn't excite me or provoke any lust in me.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.93,0:43:59.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您就没听过一点谣传么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you heard any rumors of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.61,0:44:02.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一点儿也没 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}none at all, your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:04.11,0:44:06.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这不是我能力方面的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is not anything to do with my virility.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:07.14,0:44:12.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}实际上在这些夜晚我曾有过两次射精\N{\fnArial\fs30}Indeed these last nights I have had duas pollutiones nocturnas in somno.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.72,0:44:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两次射精\N{\fnArial\fs30}two nocturnal emissions.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:15.63,0:44:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}you see,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.32,0:44:18.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道我跟谁都能行房\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know myself perfectly able to perform.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.60,0:44:22.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}唯独跟她不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}The act with others, just not with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.22,0:44:24.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和她\N{\fnArial\fs30}With her,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.86,0:44:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我根本没欲望做夫妻之间该做的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no appetite to do what a man should do to his wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:53.82,0:44:56.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 克伦威尔大人 - 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- my lord cromwell? - your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.41,0:45:03.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 可以和您单独谈谈吗 - 单独\N{\fnArial\fs30}- May we speak alone? - alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:06.29,0:45:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, ja. of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.98,0:45:16.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}My lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.70,0:45:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人 恕我冒昧 我来是为一件棘手的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}madam, I have come on a delicate matter. forgive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:21.00,0:45:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:22.86,0:45:26.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}必须警告您 切勿惹恼国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must warn you against antagonizing the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.98,0:45:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}请您谨记 尽最大努力\N{\fnArial\fs30}I must remind you of the expediency of doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.05,0:45:34.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}顺应陛下的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your utmost to make yourself agreeable to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.46,0:45:39.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生 我都不知道是哪里冒犯了国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}sir, I am not sure how I have given his majesty offence.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.95,0:45:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您与国王的婚姻美满\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is in your interest, and in mine,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:46.48,0:45:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对您对我都有利\N{\fnArial\fs30}To make your marriage to the king a success.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.66,0:45:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果 您能很快怀上孩子的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}If, for example, you were to find yourself quick with child…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.48,0:46:02.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很抱歉要跟您讨论这等私事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry to talk of such intimate.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:02.44,0:46:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但您作为一国之母\N{\fnArial\fs30}Matters but you are the queen of england.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.55,0:46:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您就不再有私事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have nothing private anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.49,0:46:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}国王不碰我的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}How am I to become quick with child.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.59,0:46:14.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我又怎么很快怀上孩子呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}when the king leaves me a maid?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.95,0:46:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不是圣母玛利亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not the virgin mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.72,0:46:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}既然您说 我没有私事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And since you say me I am nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.00,0:46:25.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么我要告诉您 这事一点不令人愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Private then I say you it is not all pleasing.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.46,0:46:28.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会竭尽所能讨国王欢心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will do anything the king wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:28.13,0:46:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但有时\N{\fnArial\fs30}But sometimes…
Dialogue: 0,0:46:30.40,0:46:34.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他腿上的伤口会恶化 渗出脓血\N{\fnArial\fs30}The sore on his leg is bad. It oozes blood and pus.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.83,0:46:36.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且有气味\N{\fnArial\fs30}And It smells.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.79,0:46:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恶臭难忍\N{\fnArial\fs30}It stinks!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.67,0:46:41.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恶臭 您明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It smells, ja. you understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.18,0:46:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对不起 大人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I am sorry, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:48.62,0:46:54.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会继续努力讨国王欢心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will go on doing all that I can to make myself agreeable to his majesty,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.68,0:46:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他对我始终那么和蔼友善\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is always gracious and kind to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.45,0:47:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}your majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.81,0:47:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人 您觉得国王怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}madam, how do you find the king?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:31.73,0:47:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了 布莱恩女士 他很和蔼亲切\N{\fnArial\fs30}why, he is most kind and solicitous, lady bryan.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.61,0:47:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他上床时 他会吻我 再牵着我的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}When he comes to bed he kisses me, ja, e takes my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.70,0:47:45.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对我说 晚安 爱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}and bids me, "good night, sweetheart."
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.26,0:47:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后在早上 他会再次吻我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then in the morning he kisses me again.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.90,0:47:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并说声 再会 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and says, "farewell, darling."
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.60,0:47:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}夫人 我们都希望您能尽快怀上孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}my lady, we all hope you will be with child soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.80,0:48:00.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很清楚我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know very well I am not.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.02,0:48:05.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您怎么会知道你不行呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}but how do you know you are not?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.07,0:48:08.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我再清楚不过了 我不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it well. I am not.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.90,0:48:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想陛下您还是个处女\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think your majesty is a maid still.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.66,0:48:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他必须把他那物件放进您身体 搅动一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}He must put his member inside you and stir it,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.05,0:48:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}否则我们将不会有约克公爵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or else we shall not have a duke of york,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.13,0:48:29.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这可是万众期待的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}which all this realm desires.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.13,0:48:30.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很满足了 布莱恩女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am contented, lady bryan!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:32.02,0:48:35.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得到了我所希望的 国王的最多的关怀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I receive as much of the king's attentions as I wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:35.41,0:48:37.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道还能要求什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know no more!
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.37,0:48:57.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}布莱恩女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lady bryan?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:59.03,0:49:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}yes, your majesty?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.22,0:49:04.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我不能讨国王欢心\N{\fnArial\fs30}if I cannot please the king…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:06.90,0:49:08.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他会杀了我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will he kill me?
